WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.511 --> 00:00:18.894
As Zann had hoped, he landed in the middle of the river near the palace, with Morb and

2
00:00:18.914 --> 00:00:20.735
the Mask still shackled to him.

3
00:00:21.756 --> 00:00:23.457
"No!" Morb cried.

4
00:00:23.477 --> 00:00:27.020
"I can't—" A wave washed over his head.

5
00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:28.781
Zann yanked him up.

6
00:00:29.562 --> 00:00:30.302
"What's the matter?"

7
00:00:30.702 --> 00:00:31.043
he said.

8
00:00:31.063 --> 00:00:32.804
"Can't swim?"

9
00:00:33.776 --> 00:00:34.617
Morb glared.

10
00:00:35.477 --> 00:00:38.499
Then panic filled his eyes as he began to sink again.

11
00:00:38.519 --> 00:00:40.581
"Save me!"

12
00:00:41.702 --> 00:00:43.583
Zann pulled the villain up out of the water.

13
00:00:43.603 --> 00:00:48.627
"I'll rescue you, but only if you unshackle yourself from the Mask."

14
00:00:48.787 --> 00:00:50.408
Anger burned in Morb's eyes.

15
00:00:51.168 --> 00:00:54.431
But as more water splashed over his face, he looked nervous.

16
00:00:54.451 --> 00:00:56.752
"How do I know I can trust you?"

17
00:00:56.772 --> 00:00:59.854
"You don't know that," Zann said.

18
00:00:59.874 --> 00:01:01.836
"But what choice do you have?

19
00:01:02.556 --> 00:01:06.077
I'll let us both drown before I let you steal all the magic from Magica."

20
00:01:06.997 --> 00:01:08.198
Morb glared at him again.

21
00:01:08.978 --> 00:01:13.119
But when another wave washed over him, he whimpered and then snapped his fingers.

22
00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:15.580
The magic shackles fell away.

23
00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:22.062
Zann hesitated for a second, letting one last ripple of strong, wonderful energy run through him.

24
00:01:23.022 --> 00:01:25.383
Then he unshackled himself from the Mask too.

25
00:01:26.263 --> 00:01:28.164
The relic drifted away with the current.

26
00:01:29.076 --> 00:01:33.739
Zann winced as the Mask smashed against a rock and broke into a dozen pieces.

27
00:01:34.619 --> 00:01:36.000
The current swept them away.

28
00:01:36.020 --> 00:01:38.361
"Help me!"

29
00:01:38.862 --> 00:01:39.522
Morb gurgled.

30
00:01:40.503 --> 00:01:41.823
"You promised!"

31
00:01:42.724 --> 00:01:45.365
Zann dragged Morb out of the current to the shallows.

32
00:01:46.506 --> 00:01:51.629
Then he rubbed the fingers of his free hand together to create energy for a Swelling spell, to

33
00:01:51.669 --> 00:01:52.689
make his voice louder.

34
00:01:52.709 --> 00:01:56.832
"Help!" he called to the people in the palace square nearby.

35
00:01:57.600 --> 00:01:59.501
"I need the palace guards over here!"

36
00:02:06.364 --> 00:02:09.085
don't we zap to the university instead of walking?"

37
00:02:09.525 --> 00:02:10.025
Gliss said.

38
00:02:10.905 --> 00:02:11.766
Zann grinned at her.

39
00:02:11.786 --> 00:02:14.127
"I want to walk," he said.

40
00:02:14.147 --> 00:02:19.629
"I never really got a chance to show you guys around First City before everything happened."

41
00:02:19.649 --> 00:02:21.210
"True." Perda laughed.

42
00:02:21.850 --> 00:02:24.631
"This has been the craziest visit ever!"

43
00:02:25.691 --> 00:02:26.792
Zann had to agree.

44
00:02:27.688 --> 00:02:32.131
It was hard to believe that life was nearly back to normal less than two days after Morb's

45
00:02:32.171 --> 00:02:39.196
defeat. Just hours after Morb's capture, the king and queen had reappeared and explained why they'd quit so

46
00:02:39.256 --> 00:02:45.400
abruptly. Laddno had kidnapped one of the queen's young nephews and threatened to toss him into the vortex

47
00:02:45.660 --> 00:02:47.381
if the king and queen didn't step down.

48
00:02:48.482 --> 00:02:50.824
Still, Zann couldn't help feeling sad.

49
00:02:51.644 --> 00:02:57.048
Gliss' uncle Gar was planning to zap Gliss, Perda, and Darb back to Swamp Bottom the next day.

50
00:02:58.172 --> 00:02:59.492
When would he see his friends again?

51
00:02:59.512 --> 00:03:04.454
"It was fun watching Queen Venna's inauguration yesterday," Gliss said.

52
00:03:05.334 --> 00:03:05.994
Perda nodded.

53
00:03:06.014 --> 00:03:10.296
"I'm glad they figured out that Laddno tampered with the vote toads."

54
00:03:11.336 --> 00:03:14.217
"He never could have done it without Morb's help," Darb said.

55
00:03:15.017 --> 00:03:18.878
Even though the king and queen had returned to the palace, they'd decided to retire.

56
00:03:19.738 --> 00:03:22.999
They promised to do everything they could to support Queen Venna.

57
00:03:23.820 --> 00:03:25.020
Gliss took Darb's hand.

58
00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:28.361
"I think Venna will make a good queen.

59
00:03:29.401 --> 00:03:33.602
For one thing, she's promising to meet with the leaders of the Void Rights groups."

60
00:03:34.843 --> 00:03:36.583
"Not Laddno," Perda said.

61
00:03:36.603 --> 00:03:38.344
"The real leaders."

62
00:03:38.364 --> 00:03:43.825
"We're here," Zann said as they reached the entrance to the university campus.

63
00:03:43.845 --> 00:03:46.526
"Are you sure you want to see this?"

64
00:03:47.466 --> 00:03:48.066
Perda nodded.

65
00:03:48.086 --> 00:03:51.647
"I want to see for myself that he can't get free."

66
00:03:52.548 --> 00:03:53.928
Gliss and Darb nodded too.

67
00:03:56.764 --> 00:03:59.987
At one end of the campus, there was an enormous, clear cube.

68
00:04:00.908 --> 00:04:04.331
A small island sat in the middle of it, surrounded by deep water.

69
00:04:05.232 --> 00:04:09.856
The island contained a chair, a table, a cot—and Morb.

70
00:04:10.797 --> 00:04:13.379
He sat slumped in the chair, looking miserable.

71
00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:16.382
The prison cube had been Teplo's idea.

72
00:04:17.163 --> 00:04:24.009
It was laced with spells—some that provided Morb with food and other basic necessities, and some that ensured

73
00:04:24.029 --> 00:04:26.630
that he couldn't break out or communicate with anyone.

74
00:04:26.650 --> 00:04:31.232
"If he tries anything evil, we'll know right away," Zann said.

75
00:04:31.252 --> 00:04:32.452
"Let's go.

76
00:04:32.832 --> 00:04:34.453
My parents are expecting us at the lab."

77
00:04:37.014 --> 00:04:39.195
"Why do they want us to come to the lab, anyway?"

78
00:04:39.535 --> 00:04:40.575
Gliss said as they walked.

79
00:04:40.595 --> 00:04:46.738
"Maybe they need our help cataloging the relics, now that Mari isn't around anymore," Perda said.

80
00:04:47.558 --> 00:04:51.600
Zann felt sorry for Mari, who'd gone into hiding along with most of her family.

81
00:04:52.524 --> 00:04:57.247
Queen Venna had sentenced Laddno to a year of hard labor on the slopes of Mount Mystery.

82
00:04:58.327 --> 00:05:01.289
"I'm glad all the relics were recovered," Perda said.

83
00:05:01.309 --> 00:05:06.772
"Boz says they even managed to fish all the pieces of the Mask of Zanta out of the

84
00:05:06.812 --> 00:05:11.195
river." "I wonder what they'll do with the relics now," Gliss said.

85
00:05:13.356 --> 00:05:16.578
When they stepped into the lab, there was a burst of lights and music.

86
00:05:16.598 --> 00:05:20.460
"Surprise!" many voices cried.

87
00:05:21.904 --> 00:05:22.685
Zann grinned.

88
00:05:23.506 --> 00:05:24.666
The place was packed.

89
00:05:24.887 --> 00:05:30.992
His parents and Boz were there, along with Teplo, Fala, Gliss' uncle, and many other people.

90
00:05:32.193 --> 00:05:33.233
Even Maff was there.

91
00:05:33.253 --> 00:05:37.697
"We wanted to throw your friends a going-away party," Nax explained.

92
00:05:37.717 --> 00:05:41.660
"And also a thank-you party for saving Magica."

93
00:05:41.680 --> 00:05:44.162
"Again!" Fala added.

94
00:05:44.182 --> 00:05:46.564
"Thanks," Zann said.

95
00:05:46.584 --> 00:05:48.486
"You didn't have to do this."

96
00:05:48.506 --> 00:05:50.668
"Sure we did.

97
00:05:51.112 --> 00:05:52.173
And there's more.

98
00:05:52.713 --> 00:05:53.694
These are for you."

99
00:05:54.554 --> 00:05:58.517
His mother handed each of the kids a silver twig with a crystal on the end.

100
00:05:58.537 --> 00:06:00.619
"Are these from Atmo?"

101
00:06:00.879 --> 00:06:01.459
Zann asked.

102
00:06:02.280 --> 00:06:03.180
His father grinned.

103
00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:05.762
"It's our latest invention."

104
00:06:06.763 --> 00:06:10.445
"Wyssa helped us before she left Magica," Asta said.

105
00:06:10.465 --> 00:06:14.348
"They're called zap accelerators," Boz said.

106
00:06:14.368 --> 00:06:20.092
"They'll allow you to travel between First City and Swamp Bottom with a single zap.

107
00:06:20.956 --> 00:06:23.558
Now you kids can visit each other whenever you like!"

108
00:06:24.619 --> 00:06:27.420
Zann was so stunned that he couldn't speak for a second.

109
00:06:28.281 --> 00:06:31.683
The past couple of weeks had been strange and often scary.

110
00:06:32.704 --> 00:06:39.148
But this was the best happy ending—and surprise extra birthday gift—that he could ever have hoped for!

111
00:06:39.168 --> 00:06:41.250
"Wow, thanks!"

112
00:06:41.650 --> 00:06:42.711
he exclaimed at last.

113
00:06:43.691 --> 00:06:45.833
His heart swelled with good feelings.

114
00:06:45.853 --> 00:06:49.055
"Now let's party!"
